style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 06219884<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Clear Europe Limited is recognized as a clearing house under the Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 and is subject to oversight by the Bank of England.<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Benchmark Administration Limited<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 08457573<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Education Limited<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 04309976<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Trade Vault Limited<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 04431957<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Endex Gas Spot LTD<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 08254731<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Interactive Data Desktop Solutions (Europe) Limited<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 05615484<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Interactive Data Desktop Solutions (Europe) Limited is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority (Reg. No. 476849).<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Markets Limited<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 04346409<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">ICE Markets Limited is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority (Reg. No. 211326).<\/span><\/p><p><b><strong class=\"font-bold\" style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">LIFFE Services Limited<\/strong><\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered office: 2nd Floor, Sancroft, Rose Street, Paternoster Square, London, EC4M 7DQ<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Registered in England and Wales Reg. No. 02452356<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">LIFFE Services Limited is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority (Reg. No. 206011).<\/span><\/p>","containerClasses":[],"__staticHtml":"<div class=\"lexical-rich-text-container\"><style>\n        .lexical-rich-text-container a[data-is-button=\"true\"] {\n          margin-top: 0 !important;\n          margin-bottom: 0 !important;\n          margin-right: 0 !important;\n        }\n      <\/style><div class=\"max-w-none font-sans [&amp;_li]:mt-4\"><div class=\"lexical-display-content\"><h3 class=\"m-0 font-headings border-0 pb-0 print:orphans-3 print:widows-3 font-medium normal-case print:break-a